2026-10-22T17:08:42 |Subject: [PATCH] Where available, use getexecpath() to make $^X absolute
2026-10-22T17:08:42 |
2026-10-22T17:08:42 |In Configure, check whether getexecpath() can be used to find the
2026-10-22T17:08:42 |absolute pathname of the executable. If so, set usegetexecpath in
2026-10-22T17:08:42 |config.sh and USE_GETEXECPATH in config.h. If this is set, then
2026-10-22T17:08:43 |use this approach in S_set_caret_X() to canonicalise $^X as an
2026-10-22T17:08:43 |absolute path. This approach works on OpenBSD.
